@startuml
title G7 enterprise patch review — dynamic sequence
autonumber
actor Reviewer
participant "React / TypeScript UI" as UI
participant "Vite dev proxy" as Vite
participant "Enterprise FastAPI" as API
database "Enterprise SQLite" as EntDB
participant "Review proxy + G6 core package" as Core
database "G6 SQLite review store" as G6DB
collections "JSONL audit chain" as Audit

Reviewer -> UI: Select a project and patch
UI -> Vite: GET /v1/images/{image_id}
Vite -> API: Forward request to 127.0.0.1:8140
API -> EntDB: Verify bearer identity and project capability
EntDB --> API: Membership and allowed role
API -> Core: Delegate project-scoped image read (in-process)
Core -> G6DB: Read allowlisted source/QC fields
G6DB --> Core: Image detail and QC fields
Core --> API: Project-scoped result
API --> Vite: Image detail response
Vite --> UI: Image detail response

UI -> Vite: POST /v1/images/{image_id}/reviews
Vite -> API: Forward review body and project header
API -> EntDB: Check review:write capability and project membership
EntDB --> API: Authorized reviewer
API -> Core: Submit review with expected revision and idempotency key
Core -> G6DB: Append revision-aware review event
G6DB --> Core: New review revision
Core --> API: Updated review state
API -> Audit: Append successful review action
API --> Vite: Updated review response
Vite --> UI: Updated review response

note over UI,G6DB
  Review state is stored separately from the immutable prediction.
  A review event does not launch training.
end note
@enduml
